sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Samir
  participant B as Samir's app
  participant DB as PostgREST + PostgreSQL
  participant A as Nora's app
  actor N as Nora
  S->>B: opens Add Friends
  B->>DB: select friends (mine), select profiles (the others)
  DB-->>B: users who are not friends yet
  S->>B: Follow on nora
  B->>DB: select follow_requests (already sent?)
  alt no request yet
    B->>DB: insert follow_requests {status: pending}
    B-->>S: the button turns to "En attente" (pending)
  end
  N->>A: opens requests (bell)
  A->>DB: select follow_requests sent or received
  alt accept
    A->>DB: delete follow_requests
    A->>DB: insert friends (nora → samir) and (samir → nora)
  else reject
    A->>DB: delete follow_requests
  end
